  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "20. Strategic Reserves",
    "ruleNumber": "20.04",
    "summary": "A unit can arrive from Strategic Reserves with this move unless it is embarked in a Transport that is also in reserves. For setup, the whole unit must be at most 6 inches from at least one board edge. Its horizontal separation from each enemy unit must exceed 8 inches. Until round 3 starts, keep all its models outside the opposing deployment zone. It cannot make another type of move before the next Charge phase starts, unless another rule permits it.",
